Plant rRNA HMMs (plant.hmm)
===========================

Used by poa's rRNA calling (pipeline/denovo_annotation/src/rrna_nhmmer.py,
a port of barrnap 0.9's `--kingdom plant` mode). Four nhmmer models:

  16S_rRNA, 23S_rRNA, 5S_rRNA   identical to db/bac.hmm of barrnap 0.9
                                (Torsten Seemann, https://github.com/tseemann/barrnap,
                                GPL-3.0); 16S is Rfam RF00177, 5S Rfam RF00001
  5S_rRNA_all_life              Rfam RF00001 (5S ribosomal RNA), all-life
                                model, https://rfam.org/family/RF00001 -
                                added because barrnap's bacterial 5S misses
                                plant organellar 5S (barrnap issue #2)

Plant organellar rRNAs are bacterial-like, so the bacterial models find the
mitochondrial rrn18/rrn26 and plastid rrn16/rrn23 genes; denovo_annotation
renames the hits per organelle.
